        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "Some datasets (Kaji and Kitsuregawa, 2006; Suzuki, 2019) are available in Japanese. However, these are sentences with sentiment polarity, and do not cover the various emotions dealt with in this study. Our study is the first to label Japanese texts with various emotional intensity.",
            "block_bbox": [
