        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "The average score for each participant was 2.1, where 1.8 at minimum, and 2.5 at maximum. There were no posts rated as 0. We had five annotators whose average score was below 2, but reviewing their posts and labels does not necessarily show obvious clues of improper annotation.",
