            ]
        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "To assess the quality of annotations, we calculated the quadratic weighted kappa $ ^{10} $ (Cohen, 1968) as a metric of the inter-annotator agreement. The upper part of Table 2 shows the agreement between the objective annotators. The best case, joy, shows",
